<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Foreigners net sellers of SAfrica shares last week.</title>
<headline>Foreigners net sellers of SAfrica shares last week.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Johannesburg Stock Exchange (JSE) said non-residents were net sellers of shares on the exchange last week.</p>
<p>Non-resident transactions (million rand) -</p>
<p>			Week to Oct 25   Year to date   Year ago</p>
<p>Equities:</p>
<p>- purchases		   709.57   33,240.92	19,727.93</p>
<p>- sales			 872.27   28,158.21	15,471.00</p>
<p>- net purchases/(sales)  (162.70)   5,082.71	 4,256.93</p>
<p>NOTE - The figures reflect only the portion of the market where non-resident transactions are executed through the JSE, and are therefore not comprehensive.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
